{"seq":3,"slug":"derivatives-perpetuals","title":"加密衍生品与永续合约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/derivatives-perpetuals","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"加密衍生品与永续合约\">加密衍生品与永续合约</h1><p>加密衍生品市场的日成交量已远超现货市场——2026 年永续合约日均名义成交额超过 $3000 亿，是所有主流 CEX 和 DEX 现货成交额总和的 4-6 倍。永续合约（perpetual futures）作为加密市场独创的衍生品结构，通过 funding rate 机制替代到期交割，成为了整个加密资产类别中最重要的价格发现和杠杆表达工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>永续合约（Perpetual Futures）</strong>：无到期日的期货合约，通过 funding rate 锚定现货价格</li>\n<li><strong>Funding Rate</strong>：多空双方定期支付的费率，使永续价格收敛于现货指数</li>\n<li><strong>基差交易（Basis Trade）</strong>：现货买入 + 永续做空的 delta-neutral 策略，赚取 funding rate</li>\n<li><strong>清算瀑布</strong>：大规模清算触发价格下跌，导致更多清算的正反馈循环</li>\n<li><strong>保险基金</strong>：交易所用于覆盖清算亏损的储备池，耗尽时触发社会化损失（ADL）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"永续合约的经济结构\">永续合约的经济结构</h2><p>永续合约是没有到期日的期货合约——持仓者通过定期支付/收取 funding rate 来保持合约价格与现货价格的锚定。这消除了传统期货的展期成本和基差风险，但引入了持续的资金成本。</p>\n<p>Funding rate 的计算通常为每 8 小时一次（部分交易所为每 1 小时）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>clamp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Funding\\_Rate = \\text{clamp}(Premium\\_Index + Interest\\_Rate, -cap, +cap)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 Premium Index 反映永续合约价格与现货指数的偏差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Premium\\_Index = \\frac{P_{perp} - P_{spot}}{P_{spot}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{perp} &gt; P_{spot}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（多头情绪主导）时，funding rate 为正——多头向空头支付费用。反之亦然。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>市场状态</th>\n<th>Funding Rate</th>\n<th>支付方向</th>\n<th>经济含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强烈看多</td>\n<td>+0.05% ~ +0.3%/8h</td>\n<td>多→空</td>\n<td>杠杆多头为看多情绪付费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中性</td>\n<td>±0.01%/8h</td>\n<td>接近零</td>\n<td>供需平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强烈看空</td>\n<td>-0.05% ~ -0.3%/8h</td>\n<td>空→多</td>\n<td>杠杆空头为看空情绪付费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端恐慌</td>\n<td>-1% ~ -3%/8h</td>\n<td>空→多</td>\n<td>去杠杆清算级别事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"funding-rate-套利-基差交易\">Funding Rate 套利：基差交易</h2><p>当永续合约 funding rate 持续为正时，存在无风险（delta-neutral）套利策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>现货买入 1 BTC</li>\n<li>永续合约做空 1 BTC（等额对冲）</li>\n<li>每 8 小时收取 funding rate 支付</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>365</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Annual\\_Return_{basis} = Funding\\_Rate \\times 3 \\times 365</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>假设平均 funding rate 为 +0.01%/8h，年化收益约 10.95%——这在传统金融中是极有吸引力的无风险利率。</p>\n<p>但「无风险」的前提是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交易所不破产（对手方风险）</li>\n<li>不被强制清算（需要充足保证金应对标记价格波动）</li>\n<li>现货可以随时卖出（流动性风险）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Funding Rate 持续为正] --&gt; B[基差交易者入场]&#10;    B --&gt; C[做空永续 + 买入现货]&#10;    C --&gt; D[永续合约空头供给增加]&#10;    D --&gt; E[永续价格被压向现货]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Funding Rate 下降]&#10;    F --&gt; G[套利利润收窄]&#10;    G --&gt; H[基差交易者部分退出]&#10;    H --&gt; I[空头减少]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Funding Rate 回升]&#10;    J --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[Funding Rate 持续为正] --&gt; B[基差交易者入场]\n    B --&gt; C[做空永续 + 买入现货]\n    C --&gt; D[永续合约空头供给增加]\n    D --&gt; E[永续价格被压向现货]\n    E --&gt; F[Funding Rate 下降]\n    F --&gt; G[套利利润收窄]\n    G --&gt; H[基差交易者部分退出]\n    H --&gt; I[空头减少]\n    I --&gt; J[Funding Rate 回升]\n    J --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"杠杆与清算的经济动力学\">杠杆与清算的经济动力学</h2><p>永续合约的核心吸引力是杠杆——用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>保证金控制</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 保证金控制</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">保证金控制</span></span></span></span></span>5-125 的名义头寸。但杠杆放大了清算风险：</p>\n<p><strong>强制清算条件</strong>：当维持保证金率不足时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Mark\\_Price \\leq Entry\\_Price \\cdot (1 - \\frac{1}{Leverage} + Maintenance\\_Margin)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ain</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 10x 杠杆多头，价格下跌约 9-10% 即触发清算。</p>\n<p><strong>清算引发的价格级联</strong>：大量清算同时触发时形成「清算瀑布」——被清算的头寸在市场上被平仓，推动价格进一步下跌，触发更多清算。2025 年 10 月 10 日事件中，前 11 大 CEX 的未平仓合约从 $1854 亿高点骤降，至今未恢复到该水平。</p>\n<p><strong>保险基金与社会化损失</strong>：当清算无法以正价值完成时（清算价差为负），差额由交易所的保险基金承担。如果保险基金耗尽，损失通过「自动减仓」（ADL）在盈利的对手方中社会化分摊——这是一种隐含的尾部风险互保机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去中心化永续合约的经济学\">去中心化永续合约的经济学</h2><p>2025-2026 年链上永续合约快速增长。Hyperliquid 作为领先的去中心化永续合约平台，2026 年 4 月月成交量达 $1903 亿，占全部永续合约市场约 3.9%。Perp DEX 的 OI 份额从 2025 年初的 3.6% 攀升至 2026 年 4 月的 13.5%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CEX 永续</th>\n<th>DEX 永续</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n<td>400ms-12s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>杠杆上限</td>\n<td>最高 125x</td>\n<td>通常 20-50x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对手方风险</td>\n<td>交易所托管</td>\n<td>智能合约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KYC</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n<td>通常无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流动性来源</td>\n<td>做市商</td>\n<td>LP 池或链上订单簿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算效率</td>\n<td>高（内部引擎）</td>\n<td>依赖 keeper 网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率</td>\n<td>低（maker 返佣）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DEX 永续的经济优势在于透明性（所有仓位和清算可链上验证）和自托管（无交易所破产风险）。劣势在于延迟导致价格发现滞后和执行质量降低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"市场结构演变-2026-年格局\">市场结构演变：2026 年格局</h2><p>CoinGecko 2026 年永续合约报告揭示的关键趋势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前 11 大 Perp CEX 月均成交量从 2025 年的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7.1</mn><mtext>万亿降至</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年的</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7.1 万亿降至 2026 年的</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万亿降至</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年的</span></span></span></span></span>4.7 万亿（降幅 34%）</li>\n<li>前 12 大 Perp DEX 月均成交量从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5317</mn><mtext>亿升至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5317 亿升至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5317</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿升至</span></span></span></span></span>6116 亿</li>\n<li>Binance 仍占 CEX 永续约 33% 份额，OKX 约 15%</li>\n<li>Hyperliquid 在 DEX 领域占约 39.5% 份额</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种结构性转移反映了：MiCA 等监管框架提高了 CEX 的合规门槛、用户对 FTX 式交易所风险的警觉提升了自托管需求、以及链上基础设施的性能改善降低了 DEX 的使用摩擦。</p>\n<p>关于永续合约价格如何引导整个加密市场的价格发现过程，参见 <a href=\"crypto-market-microstructure\">加密市场微观结构</a>。永续合约的 funding rate 作为市场情绪指标，也是 <a href=\"../foundations/tokenomics-supply-demand\">代币经济学</a> 中需求侧分析的重要数据源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>永续合约已成为加密市场最核心的金融基础设施——日成交额超 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3000</mn><mtext>亿，是现货的</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>倍。其经济结构的独特之处在于</mtext><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext>机制替代了传统期货的到期和展期，创造了持续的多空博弈和套利机会。</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年的结构性变化是</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>X</mi><mtext>份额下降（月均从</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3000 亿，是现货的 4-6 倍。其经济结构的独特之处在于 funding rate 机制替代了传统期货的到期和展期，创造了持续的多空博弈和套利机会。2026 年的结构性变化是 CEX 份额下降（月均从</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿，是现货的</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">倍。其经济结构的独特之处在于</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">机制替代了传统期货的到期和展期，创造了持续的多空博弈和套利机会。</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年的结构性变化是</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">份额下降（月均从</span></span></span></span></span>7.1 万亿降至 $4.7 万亿）而 DEX 份额上升（OI 占比达 13.5%），反映了监管压力和自托管需求的共同作用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"加密衍生品与永续合约","id":"加密衍生品与永续合约"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"永续合约的经济结构","id":"永续合约的经济结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Funding Rate 套利：基差交易","id":"funding-rate-套利-基差交易"},{"level":2,"text":"杠杆与清算的经济动力学","id":"杠杆与清算的经济动力学"},{"level":2,"text":"去中心化永续合约的经济学","id":"去中心化永续合约的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"市场结构演变：2026 年格局","id":"市场结构演变-2026-年格局"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"稳定币机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/stablecoin-mechanism-design"},"next":{"title":"DAO 治理经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/governance-regulation/dao-governance-economics"}}